Here is the complete, production-grade Admin System Codex for your application. It contains all database schemas, security triggers, TypeScript interfaces, service logic, and React frontend components ready to copy and paste into any project.
System Architecture Highlights
Multi-Tier RBAC: admin (Super Admin), moderator (Sub-Admin / Small Admin), batch_representative (Batch Coordinator), and member.
Zero Self-Approval Protection: Administrators are strictly prevented from approving their own verification documents.
Storage Protection: Verification documents are previewed using 1-hour expiring signed tokens (createSignedUrl).
Auto-Reconciliation Trigger: Approving a user's ID document immediately marks their profile as 'verified', records the reviewing admin's ID and timestamp, and clears all pending queues.
Moderation & Audit Trail: Soft-deletion (is_deleted = true), Pin to Top, and append-only audit_logs tracking every action.
